<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Abu Abdallah Muhammad (Afrighid)</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. 995</span> · <a href="/centuries/10th-century">10th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Abu Abdallah Muhammad was the last Afrighid shah of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/khwarazm">Khwarazm</a>, ruling from Kath on the lower <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/oxus">Amu Darya</a> in the late 10th century. In 995 the emir of the rival city of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gurganj">Gurganj</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mamun-ibn-muhammad">Ma'mun ibn Muhammad</a>, overthrew and killed him and founded the Ma'munid dynasty, uniting Khwarazm under Gurganj.</p></div>
